{"id":"forecast-18","section":2,"path":"bank/listening/forecast-18/audio-2.mp3","model":"small","duration":347.16,"segments":[{"start":1.97,"end":5.61,"text":"Now turn to section 2 on page 3.","words":[["Now",1.97,2.59],["turn",2.59,2.91],["to",2.91,3.13],["section",3.13,3.41],["2",3.41,4.05],["on",4.05,4.77],["page",4.77,5.07],["3.",5.07,5.61]]},{"start":11.21,"end":12.01,"text":"Section 2.","words":[["Section",11.21,11.43],["2.",11.43,12.01]]},{"start":13.25,"end":18.81,"text":"You will hear a woman talking on a radio program about a festival that is about to take place.","words":[["You",13.25,13.45],["will",13.45,13.61],["hear",13.61,13.79],["a",13.79,13.95],["woman",13.95,14.25],["talking",14.25,14.73],["on",14.73,14.99],["a",14.99,15.13],["radio",15.13,15.43],["program",15.43,16.05],["about",16.05,16.65],["a",16.65,16.85],["festival",16.85,17.23],["that",17.23,17.53],["is",17.53,17.65],["about",17.65,17.87],["to",17.87,18.07],["take",18.07,18.27],["place.",18.27,18.81]]},{"start":19.83,"end":25.39,"text":"First you have some time to look at questions 11 to 18 on page 3.","words":[["First",19.83,20.51],["you",20.51,20.77],["have",20.77,20.95],["some",20.95,21.11],["time",21.11,21.45],["to",21.45,21.71],["look",21.71,21.87],["at",21.87,22.03],["questions",22.03,22.37],["11",22.37,23.09],["to",23.09,23.33],["18",23.33,23.83],["on",23.83,24.63],["page",24.63,24.89],["3.",24.89,25.39]]},{"start":55.84,"end":60.06,"text":"Now listen carefully and answer questions 11 to 18.","words":[["Now",55.84,56.24],["listen",56.24,56.6],["carefully",56.6,57.12],["and",57.12,57.58],["answer",57.58,58.06],["questions",58.06,58.52],["11",58.52,59.28],["to",59.28,59.52],["18.",59.52,60.06]]},{"start":60.06,"end":69.23,"text":"I have in the studio with me Mary Smith from Yorktown Tourism, who is here to tell us about","words":[["I",60.06,61.24],["have",63.93,64.17],["in",64.17,64.29],["the",64.29,64.41],["studio",64.41,64.77],["with",64.77,65.13],["me",65.13,65.31],["Mary",65.31,65.71